  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTERNATIONAL ELECTION OBSERVATION FOR ZIMBABWE (IEOZ) PROGRAM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the ieoz activity goal is to promote a more transparent, inclusive, and legitimate electoral process and demonstrate international interest in and commitment to the credibility of zimbabwes 2023 harmonized elections through third-party, expert electoral assessment and observation based on international standards.</narrative>
  </description>
